    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Blog Post → Auto-Share to Social\nPublish a blog post and it's automatically shared to X, LinkedIn, your Facebook Page and Telegram within the hour — with the title, a short teaser and the link.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open **New Blog Post (RSS)** and paste your feed URL (usually `yoursite.com/feed`, `/rss` or `/blog/rss.xml`).\n2. Set up credentials for the platforms you use (see workflow 06's README for X, LinkedIn, Facebook and Telegram instructions) and fill in **Config**.\n3. Delete the \"Post to ...\" nodes for platforms you don't use.\n4. Click **Activate**.\n\nFull guide: README.md in this workflow's folder.",
        "height": 396,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
